{
  "id": "douyin-images",
  "platform": "douyin",
  "mode": "images",
  "name": "抖音 · 图集",
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "name": "标题生成",
      "type": "title",
      "needs": [],
      "promptTemplate": "douyin/images/title.md",
      "humanGate": true,
      "defaultProvider": "cli-claude"
    },
    {
      "id": "content",
      "name": "图集文案生成",
      "type": "content",
      "needs": [
        "title"
      ],
      "promptTemplate": "douyin/images/content.md",
      "defaultProvider": "cli-claude"
    },
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "name": "首图生成",
      "type": "cover",
      "needs": [
        "title"
      ],
      "promptTemplate": "douyin/images/cover.md",
      "defaultProvider": "api-jimeng",
      "coverSizes": [
        {
          "w": 1080,
          "h": 1440,
          "label": "抖音图集 3:4"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "review",
      "name": "评审评分",
      "type": "review",
      "needs": [
        "title",
        "content"
      ],
      "promptTemplate": "common/review.md",
      "defaultProvider": "api-deepseek"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "图集 3-12 张，首图决定点击率，必须放最强信息点",
    "每张图一个信息点，文字大且居中，保证手机端可读",
    "图片统一风格（配色/字体/版式）",
    "描述文案带 3-5 个话题标签",
    "避免图片中出现水印、二维码、其他平台 logo"
  ]
}
